sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as gRPC Client
    participant PR as PanicRecovery
    participant RI as RequestID
    participant TR as Tracing
    participant ME as Metrics
    participant LO as Logging
    participant AU as RequireAuth
    participant CM as ContextInterceptor
    participant H as gRPC Handler

    Note over PR,CM: Registered via FullUnaryInterceptors(cfg)\nmetrics.Init called once (sync.Once)

    Client ->>+ PR: Unary RPC call
    Note over PR: defer recover() → codes.Internal on panic

    PR ->>+ RI: next
    Note over RI: read/generate x-request-id\nstore in Go context

    RI ->>+ TR: next
    Note over TR: extract traceparent\nstart OTel server span (scope=ServiceName)

    TR ->>+ ME: next
    Note over ME: record grpc_server_inflight_requests +1\ndefer: observe duration + sizes

    ME ->>+ LO: next
    Note over LO: defer: structured grpc_request log\nInfo(OK) / Warn(client) / Error(server)

    LO ->>+ AU: next
    alt missing x-user-id or x-tenant-id
        AU -->> Client: codes.Unauthenticated
    else metadata valid
        AU ->>+ CM: next
        Note over CM: build RequestContext{UserID,TenantID,Roles,ClientIP}\nstore in Go context via domain.ContextWithRequestContext

        CM ->>+ H: next
        H -->>- CM: response, error
        CM -->>- AU: return
        AU -->>- LO: return
    end

    LO -->>- ME: return
    Note over LO: grpc_request log written
    ME -->>- TR: return
    Note over ME: metrics observed
    TR -->>- RI: return
    RI -->>- PR: return
    PR -->>- Client: response
